sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Op as Operator / APTP-front
  participant API as POST runtime-hints
  participant DM as drive_manager
  participant Hints as run_hints Redis
  participant CP as pipeline_checkpoint
  participant Orch as ProductQAOrchestrator
  participant Gate as target_url.py

  Orch->>Gate: intake_has_target_url after indexing
  alt URL found in PDF metadata or hints
    Gate-->>Orch: true
    Orch->>Orch: intake_interpretation continues
  else URL missing
    Gate-->>Orch: false
    Orch->>CP: save_checkpoint awaiting_target_url
    Orch-->>Op: status awaiting_input<br/>stage awaiting_target_url
    Note over Op: TargetUrlRequiredGate UI
    Op->>API: target_url + run_id
    API->>DM: provide_target_url_and_resume
    DM->>Hints: set_run_hints target_url
    DM->>CP: load_checkpoint + clear
    DM->>Orch: run_phase1 resume_from intake_interpretation
    Orch->>Orch: skip guardrails indexing gate
    Orch->>Orch: normalize_intake_documents
  end
